{"custom_field": "", "question_text": {"বীজগণিত": [{"id": "1", "question": "১) x + (1/x) = &radic;2 হলে x<sup>2</sup> + (1/x)<sup>2</sup> এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 1", "option2": "খ) 2", "option3": "গ) 0", "option4": "ঘ) - 1", "answer": "3", "exp": "প্রশ্ন:&nbsp; x + (1/x) = &radic;2 হলে x<sup>2</sup> + (1/x)<sup>2</sup> এর মান কত?<br /><br />সমাধান:<br />দেওয়া আছে<br />x + (1/x) = &radic;2<br /><br />প্রদত্ত রাশি = x<sup>2</sup> + (1/x)<sup>2</sup><br />= (x + 1/x)<sup>2</sup> - 2.x.1/x<br />= (&radic;2)<sup>2</sup> - 2<br />= 2 - 2<br />= 0"}, {"id": "2", "question": "২) a + b = 8 এবং ab = 15 হলে, a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> এর মান কত হবে?", "option1": "ক) 94", "option2": "খ) 34", "option3": "গ) 30", "option4": "ঘ) 124", "answer": "2", "exp": "প্রশ্ন:&nbsp;a + b = 8 এবং ab = 15 হলে, a<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ b<sup>2</sup> এর মান কত হবে?<br /><br />সমাধান:&nbsp;<br />a + b = 8&nbsp;<br />ab = 15<br /><br />আমরা জানি<br />a<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ b<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= (a + b)<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;- 2ab<br />= 8<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;- 2 &times; 15<br />= 64 - 30<br />= 34"}, {"id": "3", "question": "৩) a<sup>4</sup> + 4 এর উৎপাদক কোনটি?", "option1": "ক) (a<sup>2</sup> + 2a + 2)", "option2": "খ) (a<sup>2</sup> + 2a - 2)", "option3": "গ) (a<sup>2</sup> + a + 2)", "option4": "ঘ) (a<sup>2</sup> - a + 2)", "answer": "1", "exp": "প্রশ্ন:&nbsp;a<sup>4</sup>&nbsp;+ 4 এর উৎপাদক কোনটি?&nbsp;<br /><br />সমাধান:&nbsp;<br />a<sup>4</sup>&nbsp;+ 4<br />= (a<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ 2a<sup>2</sup>.2 + 2<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;- 4a<sup>2</sup><br />= (a<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ 2)<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;- (2a)<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;<br />= (a<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ 2a + 2)(a<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;- 2a + 2)"}, {"id": "4", "question": "৪) a³ - 21a - 20 = 0 সমীকরণে a এর মান নয় কোনটি?", "option1": "ক) - 1", "option2": "খ) 5", "option3": "গ) - 4", "option4": "ঘ) 2", "answer": "4", "exp": "প্রশ্ন:&nbsp;a<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;- 21a - 20 এর উৎপাদকে বিশ্লেষণ কোনটি?<br /><br />সমাধান:<br />ধরি, f(a) = a<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;- 21a - 20<br 